arped by the piece of the dark spirit that resides in him. He thinks that the Sept fed him to the Hive as fodder during their raid knowing he would die. Enraged he leads the BSD on countless raids against the sept, his primary target is always its kinfolk but doesn't mind taking would be heroes as well if the opportunity presents itself. Once captured he does some Strangeland-esque torture and brain washing on them above and beyond the 'normal' BSD behavior.<br /> <br /> Pretty much use you imagination on the medieval and more modern devices he has access to. His hive is based out of an old coal plant that still runs so he has access to all the amenities.<br /> <br /> He always carries the Klaive which has been deeply corrupted now; The war spirit shares its new found pain with all those whose blood it tastes (Treat effect as the same as the Visceral Agony Gift).<br /> <br /> He also has an old iron branding iron, by spending 1 Rage it activates and glows a deep bale-fire green that leaves his mark permanently on the flesh and the spirit of the victim. The physical scar can be removed temporarily but it will eventually resurface on skin again. The mark it leaves on the soul cannot be hidden, when viewed in umbra it glows the same deep bale-fire green. This reduces all social rolls by 1 dice with all Gaian spirits and shifters who see it. It also smells of the Wyrm by anyone using Sense Wyrm and It also reduces the difficulty for its owner to track his victim's by 2 including tracking gifts.<br /> <br /> To add insult to injury, by using a combination of sorcery and spirit magic he is able to bind the spirit of a Beaten Dog into the brand transforming it into a Scar fetish that he controls. Without any effort he can force the wearer back to their breed form (Treat this as the Philodox gift &quot;Take the true Form). This is done through a Rite bestowed upon him by the dark spirit that partially inhabits him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1619,"user_link":"https: